@startuml activity-manage-shipping-methods
' Manage shipping methods (Administration module). Add is above the list;
' Edit, Activate/Deactivate and Delete are on each row. Only ACTIVE
' methods are offered at checkout. Delete marks the method deleted.

title Manage shipping methods

|Admin|
|Coffee Shop System|

|Admin|
start
:1 · Open Manage Shipping Methods;
|Coffee Shop System|
:Show the shipping methods\n(Edit, Activate/Deactivate, Delete);
|Admin|
switch (What next?)
case ([done])
  stop
case ([add or edit])
  :2 · Click Add, or Edit on a method;
  |Coffee Shop System|
  :Show the form\n(empty, or the method's details);
  repeat
    |Admin|
    :3 · Enter name, description, price, then click Save;
    |Coffee Shop System|
    :Check the form;
  backward :Show the errors;
  repeat while (Valid?) is ([no]) not ([yes])
  :Save the method;
case ([status])
  |Admin|
  :4 · Click Activate or Deactivate;
  |Coffee Shop System|
  :Change the status\n(ACTIVE or INACTIVE);
case ([delete])
  |Admin|
  :5 · Click Delete, then confirm;
  |Coffee Shop System|
  :Mark the method deleted;
endswitch
|Coffee Shop System|
:Show the updated list;
stop

@enduml
